**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Food Delivery**

| Goal ID | Goal Title                     | Text                                                                                                               | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type | Relation |
|---------|--------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------|-----------|----------|
| G1      | Deliver Food to Inpatient Room | Ensure that a meal is delivered from the kitchen to the patient’s room on an order‑by‑order basis.               | #                  | Perform   | –        |
| G2      | Determine Delivery Method      | Decide whether the robot will place the meal on the table or leave it in the tray.                                 | FALLBACK(DeliverToTable, DeliverToTray) | Perform | AND      |
| G2.1    | Deliver to Table               | Place the meal on the patient’s table using the robot’s manipulation skill.                                         | –                  | Perform | OR       |
| G2.2    | Deliver to Tray                | Leave the meal in the tray for later retrieval by the patient or an assistant.                                    | –                  | Perform | OR       |
| G3      | Acquire Food from Kitchen      | Pick up the requested meal(s) from the kitchen.                                                                    | ;                  | Perform | AND      |
| G3.1    | Navigate to Kitchen           | Move to the kitchen pickup area.                                                                                   | –                  | Perform | AND      |
| G3.2    | Pick Up Meal(s)                | Collect the correct meal(s) and verify the order.                                                                  | –                  | Perform | AND      |
| G4      | Transport to Room              | Move the meal from the kitchen to the patient’s room, including door access.                                        | ;                  | Perform | AND      |
| G4.1    | Navigate to Room               | Move to the patient’s room.                                                                                         | –                  | Perform | AND      |
| G4.2    | Manage Door Access             | Open the room door, possibly with assistance from another robot or a human.                                       | –                  | Perform | AND      |
| G5      | Assist Retrieval if Needed     | If the patient can retrieve the meal from the tray, indicate which meal to take and track the retrieval.          | #                  | Perform | AND      |
| G5.1    | Query Inpatient Retrieval Capability | Retrieve the patient’s record to determine whether the patient, a companion, a nurse or another robot can fetch the meal. | – | Query   | AND      |
| G5.2    | Assist Retrieval               | Indicate the correct meal, track its retrieval and alert if the wrong meal is taken.                              | #                  | Perform | AND      |
| G5.2.1  | Indicate Meal to Retrieve      | Tell the patient (or assistant) which meal to take from the tray.                                                   | –                  | Perform | AND      |
| G5.2.2  | Track Retrieval Time/Location  | Monitor when and where the meal is taken.                                                                         | –                  | Perform | AND      |
| G5.2.3  | Alert Wrong Meal               | Notify the patient or staff if an incorrect meal is retrieved.                                                   | –                  | Perform | AND      |
| G6      | Retrieve Dirty Dishes          | Pick up dirty dishes from the room, possibly unassisted, with two robots or with human assistance.                | FALLBACK(Unassisted, TwoRobots, HumanAssisted) | Perform | OR       |
| G6.1    | Retrieve Dishes Unassisted    | Pick up dishes alone.                                                                                               | –                  | Perform | OR       |
| G6.2    | Retrieve Dishes with Two Robots| Two robots cooperate to pick up dishes.                                                                           | –                  | Perform | OR       |
| G6.3    | Retrieve Dishes with Human Assistance | Robot and a human cooperate to pick up dishes.                                                                    | –                  | Perform | OR       |
| G7      | Manage Door Opening            | Open the room door, possibly alone, with a human or with another robot.                                          | FALLBACK(OpenDoorAlone, OpenDoorWithHuman, OpenDoorWithRobot) | Perform | OR       |
| G7.1    | Open Door Alone                | Robot opens the door by itself.                                                                                     | –                  | Perform | OR       |
| G7.2    | Open Door with Human          | Human assists the robot in opening the door.                                                                      | –                  | Perform | OR       |
| G7.3    | Open Door with Another Robot  | Two robots cooperate to open the door.                                                                            | –                  | Perform | OR       |

