**Logical Relationships**

- **G1 → G2, G3, G4, G5, G6, G7** [AND] (parallel execution of all sub‑goals)
- **G2 → G2.1, G2.2** [OR] (FALLBACK between table and tray delivery)
- **G3 → G3.1, G3.2** [AND] (sequential navigation then pickup)
- **G4 → G4.1, G4.2** [AND] (sequential navigation then door access)
- **G5 → G5.1, G5.2** [AND] (query then assist retrieval)
- **G6 → G6.1, G6.2, G6.3** [OR] (FALLBACK among unassisted, two‑robot, human‑assisted dish retrieval)
- **G7 → G7.1, G7.2, G7.3** [OR] (FALLBACK among door opening alternatives)

Each task is linked to its parent goal with the appropriate AND/OR relation as shown in the task table.
